### Get All Users
GET http://localhost:4000/api/users

### Create New User
POST http://localhost:4000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sparsh Bansal",
  "email": "sparsh@example.com",
  "age": 20
}

### Get User by ID
GET http://localhost:4000/api/users/6ae8d64f95f83bc8dde354d7

### Update User
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/users/6ae8d64f95f83bc8dde354d7
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sparsh Bansal Updated",
  "age": 21
}

### Delete User
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/users/6ae8d64f95f83bc8dde354d7